        },
        "body": "## Description\r\n\r\n- The changes are only relevant for the `openqaoa-pyquil` package\r\n- The installation of the `openqaoa` meta-package broke down with the latest release of pyquil 4.0. We removed pyquil from the meta-package and limited its version for standalone installation to still be \r\n- The pyquil dependency has been changed to `>=4.0`\r\n- ** Fixes #293  **\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] I have performed a self-review of my code.\r\n- [x] I have commented my code and used numpy-style docstrings\r\n- [x] I have made corresponding updates to the documentation.\r\n- [x] My changes generate no new warnings\r\n- [x] I have added/updated tests to make sure bugfix/feature works.\r\n- [x] New and existing unit tests pass locally with my changes.\r\n\r\n[//]: <> (- [ ] Any dependent changes have been merged and published in downstream modules)\r\n\r\n## Type of change\r\n\r\nPlease delete options that are not relevant.\r\n\r\n- [x] Bug fix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)\r\n- [x] Breaking change (fix or feature that would cause existing functionality to not work as expected)\r\n\r\n## Note\r\n\r\nSome of the Qiskit tests are not passing and will be resolved in the following PR #301 \r\n",
